# The committed renders of the filter scenes (tests/filter_fixtures.h) under the fast coverages (GSHCPU_FILL_COVERAGE_FAST and GSHCPU_STROKE_COVERAGE_FAST), one line per scene and format:
# gshcpu_render_hash of the whole raster.  The scenes cover every primitive of the filter engine, both color spaces, 8-bit
# and float targets, maps that turn, shear, scale unevenly, mirror and turn by a quarter, and backdrop filters. Integer cells and byte layers change the source graphic the filter reads, and the filter engine itself is the same code. Every target
# must print these (make check-corpus-hash; suite/tools/xarch/shape.sh; suite/tools/xwin/shape.sh).  tools/gen-filter-hash.sh writes this file.
